  "reviewNotes": "Reviewed Rust 1.98.1 library distribution aggregate and native GNU runtime/startup attribution. Library aggregate preserves transitive runtime notices; compiler-only COPYRIGHT.html is excluded. Installed package ownership: glibc/glibc-devel 2.43-8.fc44, gcc/libgcc 16.2.1-2.fc44. GCC Runtime Library Exception 3.1 permits linked independent module target code under its own terms; preserve complete exception and GPLv3 text. Preserve glibc LICENSES and LGPL2.1. Dynamic system libraries are not redistributed in the TUI/server binary. This record deliberately supports only matching source/artifact fingerprints, not arbitrary GNU/Linux hosts.",
  "description": "Rust standard-library and GNU/Linux runtime notices.\n\nRust library notices below are the installed 1.98.1 distribution texts, preserved verbatim (the aggregate is HTML). The compiler-only COPYRIGHT.html is excluded. Linux runtime libraries libgcc_s.so.1, libm.so.6, libc.so.6 and ld-linux-x86-64.so.2 are system supplied and not redistributed inside the TUI binary. GNU startup objects are linked into the executable. Current host packages: glibc/glibc-devel 2.43-8.fc44 and gcc/libgcc 16.2.1-2.fc44. This candidate covers this native GNU target only; musl/cross targets require their own provenance.\n",
